// Vitest Snapshot v1, https://vitest.dev/guide/snapshot.html

exports[`a Party waiting on your word > fits every width, wrapped rather than cut > word at 40 1`] = `
"WORD
  Ysane of Thurrow, on The drove at
  Wend Water before the rains.
  A runner comes back down the road
  with word. The guide has stopped at
  the ford and will not go on for what
  was agreed; he says the water is
  higher than the price. Ysane of
  Thurrow has kept everyone civil so
  far and wants to know what the Guild
  wants done.
  1  Tell them to go on without him.
     [their own judgement]
  2  Send forty coin up the road and
     settle it. (40 coin)
  3  Bring them home. The crossing is
     not worth it.
      Calling them home pays 0 coin of
      the 95 the work is worth, for 1
      of 4 Beats done.
  They have waited 0 Days. With no word
  from you they act on their own
  judgement in 5 Days. The Guild holds
  5,000 coin."
`;

