exports[`every view, at 40, 60, 80 and 120 columns > is the same text as last time, at 40 > league at 40 1`] = `
"LEAGUE
    The Tallow Guild
    Standing 11, 5 on the Roster
  > The Fenwater Guild
    Standing 10, 4 on the Roster
    The Sixpenny Guild
    Standing 10, 6 on the Roster
    The Guild of the Bone Bridge
    Standing 8, 6 on the Roster
    The Kestrel Guild
    Standing 7, 5 on the Roster

Standing is the mean of what your
Patrons think of the Guild, scaled. It
is not a score and nothing is spent on
it: the only way to climb is to earn
their Regard. It buys one thing — the
calibre of the people who come to your
door."
`;

exports[`every view, at 40, 60, 80 and 120 columns > is the same text as last time, at 40 > patrons at 40 1`] = `
