      Regard +1
      Regard: came with the Guild
      On the Board: The vigil in the
      crypt at Ellersgate, 85 coin

  the mine consortium
    Factor Brede of Callow Drift
      Regard +1
      Regard: came with the Guild
      On the Board: The old workings
      above Callow Drift, 55 coin
      On the Board: The shift that
      never came up, 105 coin

  the drovers' road
    The Autumn Drove Partners
      Regard +1
      Regard: came with the Guild
      On the Board: Whoever is lifting
      beasts on the high road, 105 coin"
`;

