exports[`every view, at 40, 60, 80 and 120 columns > is the same text as last time, at 40 > roster at 40 1`] = `
"ROSTER
  4 of 12 places taken.

  Bede of Thurrow
    Age  30
    Might/Craft/Nerve/Guile  3/2/4/2
    available
    Regard for you +1: came with the
    Guild
    Never again the deep - Went down
    one time too many and came up owing
    nobody another descent.
    Sure-footed - Goes over wet stone
    and loose scree the way other
    people go along a street.

  Garrick
    Age  38
    Might/Craft/Nerve/Guile  2/4/3/3
    available
    Regard for you -1: came with the
    Guild
    Well-connected - Knows somebody in
    every hall worth knowing somebody
    in.
    Scribe - Kept somebody's ledgers
    for years, and still reads a clause
    before signing under it.

  Rual Half-hand
    Age  31
    Might/Craft/Nerve/Guile  3/2/3/5
    available
    Regard for you +2: came with the
    Guild
    Soldier once - Carried a pike for
    somebody else's argument, and kept
    the habits if not the coat.
    Hot-headed - Quick to the insult
    and quicker to answer it, which has
    its uses and its costs.

  Varr
    Age  35
    Might/Craft/Nerve/Guile  2/3/2/5
    available
    Regard for you -1: came with the
    Guild
    Ferryman's daughter - Raised on the
    water, and reads a current properly
    before setting foot in it.
    Sure-footed - Goes over wet stone
    and loose scree the way other
    people go along a street."
`;

