"THE ROSTER
  4 of 12 places taken.

  Bede of Thurrow, 30, Might/Craft/Nerve/Guile 3/2/4/2
    available
    Regard for you +1: came with the Guild
    Never again the deep - Went down one time too many and came up owing nobody another descent.
    Sure-footed - Goes over wet stone and loose scree the way other people go along a street.

  Garrick, 38, Might/Craft/Nerve/Guile 2/4/3/3
    available
    Regard for you -1: came with the Guild
    Well-connected - Knows somebody in every hall worth knowing somebody in.
    Scribe - Kept somebody's ledgers for years, and still reads a clause before signing under it.

  Rual Half-hand, 31, Might/Craft/Nerve/Guile 3/2/3/5
    available
    Regard for you +2: came with the Guild
    Soldier once - Carried a pike for somebody else's argument, and kept the habits if not the coat.
    Hot-headed - Quick to the insult and quicker to answer it, which has its uses and its costs.

  Varr, 35, Might/Craft/Nerve/Guile 2/3/2/5
    available
    Regard for you -1: came with the Guild
    Ferryman's daughter - Raised on the water, and reads a current properly before setting foot in it.
